#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/join.md:5
msgid "将两个相同形状的输入张量沿着新的最小维度连接，输出张量比输入张量多一个维度，大小为2，保持其他维度不变。"
msgstr ""
"Concatenates two input tensors of the same shape along a new minor "
"dimension. The output tensor has one more dimension than the input tensors, "
"with a size of 2, keeping other dimensions unchanged."

