msgid "`x.join(y)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`x.join(y)` - member function form"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/join.md:12
msgid "**功能：**"
msgstr "**Function:**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/join.md:14
msgid "将两个相同形状的输入张量沿着新的最小维度连接"
msgstr ""
"Concatenates two input tensors of the same shape along a new minor dimension"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Shape_Manipulation_Ops/join.md:15
msgid "输出张量比输入张量多一个维度，大小为2"
msgstr ""
"The output tensor has one more dimension than the input tensor, with a size "
